v 3
d 'STCOXEM': Cox proportional hazards model with shared gamma frailty, fit by the EM algorithm
d
d stcoxem fits the Cox model with a shared gamma frailty -- the model of
d stcox, shared() -- by the EM algorithm of Klein (1992), implemented in
d Mata for large data (hundreds of thousands of frailty groups). Estimates
d agree with stcox, shared(). It also allows strata(), vce(robust),
d vce(cluster), vce(bootstrap), and pweights, and gives a profile-likelihood
d standard error and confidence interval for the frailty variance. Results
d are stored as stcox, shared() stores them, so stcox's postestimation
d commands (predict, estat, stcurve, margins, lrtest, ...) work afterwards.
d
d Requires: Stata 19
d
d Author: Barna Szabo-Soderberg, Karolinska Institutet
d Support: https://github.com/szabobarnaKI/stcoxem
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261126
f stcoxem.ado
f stcoxem_p.ado
f stcoxem.sthlp
f stcoxem_postestimation.sthlp
